{"id":1189,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年6月29日，信息与通信工程学院招生宣传组赴黑龙江开展的招生宣传工作圆满落下帷幕。宣传组老师李小燕、毕建中，先后深入鸡西市第一中学、七台河市第一中学、宁安一中、穆棱一中宣传学校最新办学成果。</p><p>在宣讲现场，宣传组围绕中北大学的历史沿革、科研成就、师资力量、校园文化、招生政策及历年录取情况等核心内容进行了全面解读。此外，宣传组还在牡丹江万达一层咨询点集中开展了宣传咨询，对考生及家长关心的专业选择、录取位次、学生毕业发展等具体问题进行了耐心细致的解答，现场互动热烈，众多学子表达了对我校相关专业的浓厚兴趣。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUlUUbMNCbM7CaUn4WkMzNaMNWfUmUSaMRCPMNV7M4L8LzU0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8MSyiM1h2nNnRUlUYM8M2nm-aLR9bLz9YLN-inmM2M7WFMlLZM7UYMmnFnRLZozlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRNbgtA8pUzcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18499&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D4556FFDCAD27CFF200891822B5F3F4B/5C84D264/D3895\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 600px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLlWU2L7UZLzv4Mn8n2L8UiM4U8UzQS2nRN4LRLDoRLDL470gihFp2hmCIa0nky8UYh2nSh2M77iLl-aUmL4Mz9ZMzVVnmv4LRT7Lm-DM7WFMz-8M8-aozMFM7WknmnRgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRUboSbw62z8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18499&e=.jpg\"></p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td></tr><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUlUUbMNCbM7CaUn4WkMzNaMNWfUmUSaMRCPMNV7M4L8LzU0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8MSyiM1h2nNnRUlUYM8M2nm-aLR9bLz9YLN-inmM2M7WFMlLZM7UYMmnFnRLZozlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZMRNbgtA8pUzcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18499&e=.jpg"}